<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela bolivar closes down at 475.50/476.50/dlr.</title>
<headline>Venezuela bolivar closes down at 475.50/476.50/dlr.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar closed down at 475.50/476.50 per dollar as the Central Bank covered strong seasonal demand for dollars, traders said.</p>
<p>On Friday, the unit closed at 474.75/475.75</p>
<p>&quot;One bank came with a large demand, apparently for a multinational ... and consequently the bolivar fell down to 477&quot; until the Central Bank moved in, one trader said.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 834405))</p>
</text>
